Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想我们再去一次那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I-I think maybe we could go back out there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让那东西咬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get that thing to bite me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们两个都能当超级英雄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we could both be superheroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了  你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! What? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔  你可不能独占这好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, you can't keep this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么独占\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep what to myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不知道这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know what this thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然还想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell would you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔  我不想再做猪仔(《蝇王》中的人物)了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael...I don't -- I don't want to be piggy anymore, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're -- you're not a pig, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.89,0:14:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  听我说  你没什么不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, listen to me. There's nothing wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要弄清自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just got to figure out what it is you want
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后全力争取\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  你不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you -- you don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太对了  我不想变得超级强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, 'cause I don't want to be super-strong
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者能泡上妞儿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}or have a prayer of getting any ass this year or...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不开  -不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not it. - Not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  伙计们  是联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dudes, dudes, dudes. It's the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  -你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, there. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯特工和哈德森特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agents Rose and Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:57.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想问几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to ask you a few questions
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于几个街区外的那桩凶杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the murder that occurred a few blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  你认识被害人雅各布·卡特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}First off, did you know the victim, Jacob Carter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不太熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得那天晚上有什么怪事发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember anything unusual about that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  听说这附近有谁...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, uh, heard about anyone in the neighborhood getting,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被咬伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh -- getting bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.44,0:15:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-配合一下  -我想没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Humor me. - No, I-I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  没关系  这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, no worries. How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你听到什么奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hear anything strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call us...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多晚都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据目前的线索来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, based on what we've got so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能又是个玛雅神\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could be dealing with another Mayan god.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's fantastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.38,0:15:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次轻松摆平嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the other one was such a joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去学校宿舍看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Campus dormitories?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局正在找咬你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI are looking for what bit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是《X档案》那种事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you an "X-file"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:16:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他才不是  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's not an "X-file." Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...来看  可能又是个玛雅神\N{\fnArial\fs30}...so far, we could be dealing with another Mayan god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a golden god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a golden god!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a golden god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, bvc?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是斯考特·帕克  \N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Scotty P.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正要跟我的伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrolling with the oak hill crew --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道格  埃文和塔克一起巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug...Evan...Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个动物杀死了当地居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, some animal killed a local citizen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们今晚出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're out here tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维护街道的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}making sure these streets are safe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护可爱的你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all you fine honeys out there, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出发吧  小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's fan out, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.23,0:18:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开  混蛋  今晚没心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off, douche-wheel. Not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好怕怕哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Oh. Ooh, I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What...what the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.75,0:18:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非抓住你不可  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got you now, you piece of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有种像个男人一样滚出来单挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come take your beating like a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不出来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you won't come out and play,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.21,0:19:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就去找你可爱的小女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go visit that little piece of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:08.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫凯特是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.05,0:19:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会去找她  让她见识下真正的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll got visit Katie, show her what a real man --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你以为这样很好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, do you think this is funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来  别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以问一个关于他的问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了这些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}With everything that's happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.58,0:19:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you afraid of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起初  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这确实挺吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was pretty scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但后来  说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...then, to be totally honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得挺性感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's actually been pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}O...M...G.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能告诉我们发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我碰到了斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh -- I ran into Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他追着我不放  然后我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chased me, and I think I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说起你来  然后我眼前一片红色\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started talking about you, and I saw red.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我恢复意识  已经在往家跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next thing I remember, I was running home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,录像里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the video...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你手上是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were those things on your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爪子吗  -有没有人看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Claws? - Did anybody see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特  你不是想替他找理由...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, you're not trying to justify...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们并不知道当时情况  布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We don't know what happened, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  他就不能正当防卫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? He can't defend himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就猜到你们还会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured I'd see you guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你工作到位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you did your job right,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不用来了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we wouldn't be here, would we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.49,0:20:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Uh, so, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:55.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者叫斯考特·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vic's name was Scott Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.27,0:20:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来杀死了卡特的东西再下杀手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the same thing that killed the Carter kid got Mr. Parker here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个地方警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I'm only the local yokel,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子是被动物给撕碎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this kid was shredded by an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的心脏呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巡警在那边找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrolman found it up the way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分被吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eaten mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃下了一颗人心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you eat a human heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有没有  -你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you? - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯考特死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被人撕碎挖出了心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was shredded, and his heart's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也未必是迈克尔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't mean that Michael --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你以为怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的心脏哪儿去了  迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's his heart, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不记得发生了什么  -别撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't remember what happened. - Don't lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Brian, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定发生了一些我们不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I mean, there's got to be an explanation for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是正当防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was...self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃人心也叫正当防卫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating a heart is self-defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特  你想骗谁  我还是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, who are you trying to convince? Me or yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你想把我的心也吃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You gonna eat my heart, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:21:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我究竟是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who I am anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是迈克尔·惠勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Michael Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.57,0:22:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的  听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're mine, okay? You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特  你怎么可以这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, how -- how can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.56,0:22:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得看清现实啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to see what's really going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管他是什么  都对你很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he is, it's not good -- it's not good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔不是故意要伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael didn't mean to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.95,0:22:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明显是故意的  凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously he did, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是不懂  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What don't I understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从没爱过一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never been in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.63,0:22:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在要找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we need are answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.77,0:22:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听不到他们讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.98,0:23:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特我们到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Kate, what are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.81,0:23:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么  你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.31,0:23:06.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  凯特  别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Kate, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.59,0:23:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者身上的爪痕很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut marks on both vics are clean
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.35,0:23:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但从弯曲程度来看是动物爪子所致\N{\fnArial\fs30}but have the curvature of animal claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.77,0:23:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是四处游荡的野生动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe there's a wild animal on the loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.73,0:23:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这儿最大的动物是浣熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biggest animal in the county is a raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.19,0:23:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你的帮助  -不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you for your time. - You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打听到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did I miss? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.35,0:23:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想对浣熊发全境通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless you want to put an A.P.B. out on rocky raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,网上没有当地警局的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, the local police files are not online,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只好去查郡记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I had to dig through the county records.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:41.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十年前  有宗相似的悬案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, 10 years ago, there was a similar unsolved murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.83,0:23:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.71,0:23:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,致命伤由爪子造成  心脏被挖走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death by claws and, uh, lack of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.07,0:23:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're talking a --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.91,0:23:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  当时还不到日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not that time of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.41,0:23:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-太棒了  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awesome. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去查查资料  找点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to hit the books and feed the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.13,0:23:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定知道些东西  \N{\fnArial\fs30}They know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.49,0:23:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要跟着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.10,0:24:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔  你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael. Come on. Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.62,0:24:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.03,0:24:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.63,0:24:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手机里的全球定位系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}GPS in your phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你知道你有点吓着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're starting to creep me out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.36,0:24:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼此彼此  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feeling's mutual, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  你还能黑进什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can you hack into, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.77,0:24:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.19,0:24:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测试  测试  能听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test, test. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.73,0:24:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.47,0:24:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信号正在传入我的笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the feed is looping to my laptop right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去  确保你坐得够近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head in, make sure you're within spitting distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.93,0:24:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we should be in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.49,0:24:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, and don't get arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.96,0:24:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.72,0:24:48.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你确定  -对  把包给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Yeah. Give me the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.37,0:25:03.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We good?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往左点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...A little left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.50,0:25:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.19,0:25:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.37,0:25:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.99,0:25:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  两个汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, two burgers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.05,0:25:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都差不多一年没在这里吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I didn't eat at Big P's for like a year, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.51,0:25:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛雪亮  动脉阻塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear eyes and clogged arteries --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.13,0:25:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能差啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.77,0:25:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.10,0:25:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"被纯种头四代子孙所转化的狼人..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Werewolves that are turned up to four generations from pureblood..."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯种是说始祖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he means Alpha?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.64,0:25:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"相对温和\N{\fnArial\fs30}"...are less feral
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.55,0:25:43.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且可以在任何时候变形"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and can transform before, during, and after the lunar cycle."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:44.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯种的不会在变形过程中昏过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purebloods don't black out during the transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.30,0:25:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可以控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can control themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.16,0:25:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些可以靠动物心脏生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some have been able to subsist off of animal hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.23,0:25:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在抓捕的是一只纯种的狼人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunting a-a werewolf with a pedigree?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.76,0:26:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  希望他有证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. Let's hope he has his papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.15,0:26:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  希望银质物品可以杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and that silver can kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他十年前在这里攻击了某个可怜的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best in show comes here 10 years ago, ganked some poor woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.49,0:26:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后尘埃落定  没有嫌疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when the dust settles and everything's in the clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.36,0:26:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里住下了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he just sets up shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.54,0:26:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  为心而来  为了女大学生而留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, comes for the human hearts, stays for the co-eds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.34,0:26:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.11,0:26:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后一切安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then everything's wine and roses --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.35,0:26:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只吃动物心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And animal tickers --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.62,0:26:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到他又渴望人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until he gets the hankering for human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说这里有案子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you there was a case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.99,0:26:21.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们只要找到它杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just got to find it and kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.94,0:26:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.38,0:26:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.20,0:26:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔  别这样  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.21,0:26:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  你需要冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, you need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.32,0:26:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-冷静  我是个狼人  -我们需要找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down? I'm a werewolf! - Hey, we need to find --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.05,0:26:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局的人想要杀死我  \N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI is trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.45,0:26:37.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  都闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Everybody, shut up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.68,0:26:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing's first, those guys --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.15,0:26:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人不是联调局的  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys aren't FBI, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.37,0:26:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局的特工肯定不会老说"太棒了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure that FBI agents don't say "Awesome" that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.82,0:26:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.41,0:26:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也绝对不会追杀大学生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- and they definitely don't hunt and kill college kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.91,0:26:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还说了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did -- did they say anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.62,0:26:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  他们就坐在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, they just sat and talked about
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:26:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么他们分开一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how they have been apart for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.39,0:26:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前说搭档基情什么  没准猜对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were probably right about that whole office-romance thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.74,0:27:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.30,0:27:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特  我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, come on. What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.32,0:27:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.93,0:27:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们  你们搞错重点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, you're missing the big picture, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.32,0:27:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们完全不知道你  迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They -- they don't know about you, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.28,0:27:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在找那个人  那个什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for whoever, whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.18,0:27:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始咬你的  纯种\N{\fnArial\fs30}bit you in the first place, the pureblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.26,0:27:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.79,0:27:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样我们就有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives us some time...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.15,0:27:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}To figure it out, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.89,0:27:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.18,0:27:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我余生就只吃鸡心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, eat chicken hearts for the rest of my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.61,0:27:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael. Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:27:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.27,0:28:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  离上班时间还早着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little early for office hours, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.05,0:28:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.90,0:28:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.99,0:29:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.65,0:29:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天亮我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.26,0:29:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人  他们可能找到迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys -- look, they might find Michael, and --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  凯特  你不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Kate, you don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.48,0:29:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.50,0:29:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:29.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞定什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took care of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.15,0:29:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.41,0:29:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.22,0:29:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我是你的教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm your professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.38,0:29:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  我一直在找那个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks. I've been looking for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.46,0:29:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.65,0:29:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你咬了我朋友之后  弄丢它的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you left it... after you bit my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.04,0:29:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你在说什...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What are you --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.25,0:29:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打住打住  别想掩饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop, stop. Stop trying to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.09,0:29:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen to me very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.11,0:29:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这些都录下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm filming all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.35,0:30:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里我也藏了摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've got a hidden camera in here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.72,0:30:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信号直接传回我家的笔记本里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's feeding back to my laptop at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.55,0:30:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果我发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if anything happens to me --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.56,0:30:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  不会发生什么事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is going to happen to you, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.03,0:30:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你得冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? You need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.60,0:30:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你把我变成狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to turn me into a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.87,0:30:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  我不知道你从哪...  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, I-I don't know where you...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.78,0:30:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.48,0:30:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.33,0:30:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不如我用这个划你一下  -布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, how about I, uh, cut you with this. - Brian,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.36,0:30:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听我说  -你知道这东西是银质的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- listen to me. - This thing's made of silver, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  拜托  我不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not -- please, I'm not what you think that I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.52,0:30:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎你是什么  我只想你转化我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you are. I just want you to turn me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.89,0:30:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.50,0:30:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.76,0:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你伤害我  这些都会在CNN播出\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause if you do, all of this winds up on CNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.76,0:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.05,0:30:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无意间撞见了卡特  变身  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you stumbled on Carter, wolfed out, and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.03,0:30:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又开荤吃人心了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a taste for hearts again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.26,0:30:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种感觉忘不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never lose the taste,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.43,0:30:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你傻到会吃一次的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're stupid enough to have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.61,0:30:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦吃过人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you have a human heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.67,0:31:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎就无法控制住体内的兽性\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's almost impossible to control the monster inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.01,0:31:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我做到了  直到上周我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did, until last week when I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.54,0:31:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像俗话说的那样  旧瘾复发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fell off the wagon, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.68,0:31:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不知道  这有多艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea -- no idea -- how hard it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.22,0:31:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直努力不让自己伤害别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've trained myself not to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.35,0:31:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直努力让自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have -- I have trained myself to...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.02,0:31:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强咽下其他心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}choke down those other hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.06,0:31:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动物心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animal hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.53,0:31:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都没伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'v been clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.85,0:31:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到上周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到卡特一个人  他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I saw Carter alone, and he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.73,0:31:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来很虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.14,0:31:38.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不那么容易掩盖这些事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's harder to cover things up nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.58,0:31:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道猎人迟早会发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew a hunter would catch wind of this sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.72,0:31:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did. They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.72,0:31:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要一个替罪羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed a patsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.11,0:31:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.50,0:31:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个总在我课上睡觉的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The young man who sleeps through most of my lectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.22,0:31:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会想他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who would miss him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.69,0:32:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.39,0:32:04.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.81,0:32:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要看到你们看到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see what you guys see...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做你们能做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}do what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.96,0:32:10.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再当猪仔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of being piggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.26,0:32:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.26,0:32:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想当雷尔夫(《蝇王》中的人物)\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be Ralph.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.83,0:32:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们选择不了自己的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get to choose who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.91,0:32:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.33,0:32:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-天呐  -布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my god. - Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.28,0:32:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-天呐  -你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my god. - What are you? Insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.96,0:32:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救了你们一命  不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome for saving your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.90,0:32:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.54,0:32:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.97,0:33:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还从没杀过纯种狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never killed a pureblood before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.68,0:33:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚刚在看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.25,0:33:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么名堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.85,0:33:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.49,0:33:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后患已除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.17,0:33:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们杀了那个纯种的  就不会继续查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed the pureblood, they're moving on,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.91,0:33:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你说的  我们没了后顾之忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're in the clear, just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.98,0:33:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.00,0:33:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.73,0:33:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么做是为了保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did this to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.21,0:33:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你办不到的事我办到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what you couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.69,0:33:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看见摄像机了  布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw the camera, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.40,0:33:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他们不会查到你头上来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think they'll trace that back to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.19,0:33:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.69,0:33:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.07,0:33:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.26,0:33:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是终于弄清了我想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...finally figured out what I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.01,0:33:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要努力争取了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I'm going after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.13,0:33:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我一直躲在摄像机后吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I was hiding behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.62,0:33:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直躲在你的身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hiding behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.03,0:34:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了活在你的阴影之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am done living in your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.93,0:34:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总摆脱不掉你的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always lived in your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.47,0:34:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在  我们旗鼓相当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now -- now we're equals.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.24,0:34:09.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能做到的我都行  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you can do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.38,0:34:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你以为这是比赛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You think this is a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.36,0:34:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你对自己做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what you've done to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.39,0:34:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你不肯咬我  我只好  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wouldn't bite me, so I had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.22,0:34:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让他咬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked him to?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.31,0:34:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他求你咬他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked you to bite him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.38,0:34:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没同意  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.58,0:34:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.34,0:34:25.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会伤害你  布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never hurt you, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.13,0:34:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我体内的这个恶魔  你不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing inside of me -- you don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.37,0:34:30.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说这话已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, it's too late for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.89,0:34:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得袭击斯考特的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember attacking Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.88,0:34:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得把他跳动的心从他胸膛里掏出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember ripping his beating heart out of his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.19,0:34:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得我咬那颗心时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the look in his dead eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.77,0:34:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已无生气的眼睛里的眼神  布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I bit into that heart, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.15,0:34:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的是  我记得那味道有多美\N{\fnArial\fs30}And above all, I remember how sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.38,0:34:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多好吃  自从我吃了心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}how delicious it tasted, and ever since I've tasted it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.35,0:34:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得更强大  也更失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've felt more powerful and more out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.24,0:34:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是更脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}More weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.67,0:34:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要像迈克尔这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need someone like Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要一个能照顾你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need someone that can take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.24,0:34:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.67,0:34:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.96,0:35:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然呢  你要哭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what? You gonna cry some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.15,0:35:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.17,0:35:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神  神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.46,0:35:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.04,0:35:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby. Oh, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.15,0:35:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你别死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.39,0:35:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别死  千万别死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't die. Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.58,0:35:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.19,0:35:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.34,0:35:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.45,0:35:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.18,0:35:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.18,0:36:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.38,0:36:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会理解的  你只要看到我所见到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll understand. You just need to see what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.98,0:36:06.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我咬了你  你就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I bite you, you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.62,0:36:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.19,0:36:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我不想故意吓唬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能弥补这一切  \N{\fnArial\fs30}We can fix this. We can...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.61,0:36:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就让我进来吧  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just let me in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.14,0:36:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.17,0:36:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  我出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, I'm coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.35,0:37:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.72,0:37:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it would be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.75,0:37:12.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.66,0:37:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的  给\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.94,0:37:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.63,0:37:41.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完成布莱恩的电影不是为了辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't finish Brian's movie to justify what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不瞒你们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be totally honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.51,0:37:49.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道我是不是真的明白发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really even sure if I understand it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.10,0:37:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted you to know that --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.97,0:37:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔并不是个彻头彻尾的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Michael wasn't always a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.42,0:37:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.67,0:38:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五年之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years from now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.61,0:38:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能够通过律师资格考试  做个律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully passed the bar exam, practicing law.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.90,0:38:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不去大公司干  而是环保事业之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing corporate, something green, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.94,0:38:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.09,0:38:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许去HBO工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, maybe, like, working for HBO
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.26,0:38:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者像迈克尔·摩尔那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}or -- or, like, Michael Moore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.03,0:38:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要乘船在海上航行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be on a boat in the middle of the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.55,0:38:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我美丽的女友也会伴我左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my beautiful girl by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.43,0:38:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.69,0:38:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们再也不会见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll never hear from me ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.05,0:38:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道还有其他的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know that there's another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.21,0:38:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以吃动物的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can eat animal hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.53,0:38:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.83,0:38:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正不会伤害人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody human, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.34,0:38:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是自愿变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't choose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.55,0:38:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请给我一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.62,0:39:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.44,0:39:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ...this - - Yeah --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.58,0:39:28.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是迈克尔  所以那位就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Michael, which means that that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.09,0:39:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩·威尔科特斯  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian Wilcox,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.21,0:39:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,友善的摄影师邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}our friendly neighborhood cameraman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.92,0:39:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.86,0:39:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.91,0:39:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  她比我们早差不多半天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, she's got about a half-day jump on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.68,0:39:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Kate's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.54,0:39:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没伤害任何人  至少没伤害人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't hurt anybody -- well, anybody human at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.06,0:39:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这也不是她自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she didn't -- she didn't choose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.84,0:40:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就给她一次机会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's give her a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.56,0:40:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.37,0:40:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.45,0:40:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如凯特再出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, look, if Kate pops back up,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.49,0:40:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如她犯了错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if she strays,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.94,0:40:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}then no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.99,0:40:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就做该做的事  杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do what we got to do and, um, we take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.41,0:40:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.60,0:40:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.22,0:40:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的总说"太棒了"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I really say "Awesome" a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.46,0:40:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
